<h1>How to Use KUBE Help</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p>KUBE Help can be invoked either from KUBE software by pressing <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>F1</b></span> or by clicking on 'KUBE Help' icon from KUBE program menu (<span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>start &gt; All Programs &gt; Metris &gt; KUBE vXX</b></span>).</p>
<p>Please use the Table of Contents tree in the left pane to navigate the Help.</p>
<p><img src="../images/Help.jpg" width="721px" height="537px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p>We have used a number of formatting styles in this help file to differentiate between the different kind of information. Here follow some examples of the used styles and icon and an explanation of their meaning.</p>
<h2>Help Conventions</h2>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet">The ordinary text is written in simple formatting.</p>
</li>
<li style="font-weight:normal;" class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Important Words</b></span> are in bold font.</p>
</li>
<li style="font-weight:normal;" class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span class="Path">Command paths</span> are in bold font.</p>
</li>
<li style="font-weight:bold;" class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span class="Command">Command Names</span> are in bold font.</p>
</li>
<li style="font-weight:bold;" class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span class="Shortcut">Shortcut definitions</span> are in bold font.</p>
</li>
<li style="font-weight:normal;" class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span class="Mode">Modes</span> are underlined.</p>
</li>
<li style="font-weight:normal;" class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span class="Button">Button Names</span> are in bold font.</p>
</li>
<li style="font-weight:normal;" class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><a name="bookmark"></a> <a href="#bookmark">Links to different pages or bookmarks in the current page appear in blue colour and underlined</a>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
